# The collector needs no credentials: /api/v1/models and /rankings are public,
# and the HuggingFace Hub API serves public repositories anonymously.
# Verified 2026-08-29 with no key present.
#
# Only set this if a leg is added that reads your own OpenRouter consumption
# via /api/v1/activity, which is the one endpoint that requires a key.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
